  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:emet_veyatziv/al_harishonim">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:emet_veyatziv/al_harishonim/1"/>Upon the first and upon the last, [generations]
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:emet_veyatziv/al_harishonim/2"/>[it is] a matter that is good and everlasting.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:emet_veyatziv/al_harishonim/3"/>It is true and faithful,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:emet_veyatziv/al_harishonim/4"/>a Law that will never be abrogated.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:emet_veyatziv/al_harishonim/5"/>Truly you Adonoy, are
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:emet_veyatziv/al_harishonim/6"/>our God, and the God of our fathers,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:emet_veyatziv/al_harishonim/7"/>our King the King of our fathers,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:emet_veyatziv/al_harishonim/8"/>our Redeemer, Redeemer of our fathers,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:emet_veyatziv/al_harishonim/9"/>our Former, Rock of our deliverance;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:emet_veyatziv/al_harishonim/10"/>our Liberator and our Saver
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:emet_veyatziv/al_harishonim/11"/>which is Your Name from old,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:emet_veyatziv/al_harishonim/12"/>and we have no other God
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:emet_veyatziv/al_harishonim/13"/>besides You, ever.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
